{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018AA4UR45sTJemE28XpVAKh","type":"tool_result","content":"1:# my-3D2dge API index (v0.85.2)\n5:## Units and the height rules\n22:## Examples\n47:## Contents\n108:## The engine object (E = My3D2dge)\n119:## 1. Math\n194:## 2. Pixel primitives\n213:## 2b. Sprite frames, turns and swaps\n219:## 3. Views (projections)\n246:## 4. Screen\n268:## 5. Input\n353:## 6. Pixel font\n364:## 7. Lighting\n383:## 8. Particles\n403:## 9. Renderer\n451:## 10. Game\n562:## 10b. Standard features\n579:## 10c. Boot\n584:## 10d. Tweens and scripts\n601:## 10e. Paths\n611:## 10g. Weather\n615:## 10k. Save slots\n638:## 11. Humanoid rig\n711:## 12. Blob rig\n731:## 13. Tile map\n794:## 13b. Materials\n815:## 14. Flow field\n833:## 15. Texture helpers for floortex functions\n844:## 16. Platform map\n878:## 16b. Platformer\n919:## 17. Body\n939:## 17b. Actions\n961:## 17c. Mover\n1000:## 17d. Perception\n1017:## 18. Bullets\n1037:## 19. Spatial hash\n1047:## 20. Audio\n1079:## 21b. Backdrops\n1087:## 21c. Props\n1092:## 21e. Shapes\n1104:## 21. Ui\n1161:## 21d. Shell\n1190:## 22. Gpu lighting (webgpu)\n1211:## 23. Sessions\n1220:## Module arcade: the coin-op's frame: scores, high-score tables and initials, lives, credits, turns, cards, the attract mode (engine/modules/arcade.js)\n1255:## Module click: point-and-click adventures: walk areas with holes, depth, hotspots, verbs, an inventory (engine/modules/click.js)\n1300:## Module drive: cars on the ground plane, a race round a track, the drivers who race it (engine/modules/drive.js)\n1338:## Module fight: one-on-one fighting: fighters with frame data, guards, throws, specials, a meter; rounds; a CPU; training (engine/modules/fight.js)\n1419:## Module gen: generated maps: rooms and corridors, BSP, caves, mazes and scatter, from a seed (engine/modules/gen.js)\n1430:## Module grid: square and hex grids: paths, ranges, lines, fields of view, fog, groups, movers and turns (engine/modules/grid.js)\n1489:## Module mode7: a perspective floor drawn a row at a time, a sky that turns with it, everything on it scaled by its distance (engine/modules/mode7.js)\n1512:## Module physics: 2D rigid bodies: circles, boxes, polygons, segments; fast balls that never pass through (engine/modules/physics.js)\n1541:## Module rhythm: charts on a song's steps, judged on the music clock: combos, grades, holds, a highway (engine/modules/rhythm.js)\n1573:## Module road: the pseudo-3D road: segments with curves and hills, lanes, rumble strips, roadside scenery, tunnels (engine/modules/road.js)\n1590:## Module rooms: a world of rooms joined at their edges, the map of what was explored, gates and saves (engine/modules/rooms.js)\n1619:## Module rpg: items, inventories, equipment, shops, a party's stats and levels, status, damage, encounters (engine/modules/rpg.js)\n1638:## Module songs: the songbook: the kits' best songs and more, and jingles, tagged by mood (engine/modules/songs.js)\n1646:## Module story: dialogue as data, flags and values, a quest log and emote balloons (engine/modules/story.js)\n1675:## Module strategy: real-time strategy and simulation: selection, orders, armies, production, resources, placement, fog, AI; a day clock, needs, overlays (engine/modules/strategy.js)\n1721:## Module terrain: destructible ground in the side plane: carved and added, walked on, drawn in chunks (engine/modules/terrain.js)","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"320246ab-3447-463f-809e-86ed7a6b39d9","uuid":"20969230-2ad8-49ca-81c6-a2c5614cbac7","timestamp":"2026-11-04T12:05:30.685Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"1:# my-3D2dge API index (v0.85.2)\n5:## Units and the height rules\n22:## Examples\n47:## Contents\n108:## The engine object (E = My3D2dge)\n119:## 1. Math\n194:## 2. Pixel primitives\n213:## 2b. Sprite frames, turns and swaps\n219:## 3. Views (projections)\n246:## 4. Screen\n268:## 5. Input\n353:## 6. Pixel font\n364:## 7. Lighting\n383:## 8.