{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01E41TRjyfkD36gRYkfQX4q5","type":"tool_result","content":"   weather, input sequences, the camera's window): each puts its functions here as it loads, so a kit without it has\n   nothing to call. input(game, dt) after the input's step, step(game, dt) after the timers (game time: paused, frozen\n   and slowed with the game), enter(game, old) as a scene starts (before its enter), draw(game, r, g) over the lit\n   world, under the overlays; rot(spr, a, steps): a sprite turned (section 2b); frame(game, shx, shy): a split screen's\n   viewports drawn (section 10j); pose(dt, s): the traversal moves' poses, on the rig (this; section 16c); pause(shell, acts):\n   the pause menu's Save and Load (section 10k); FADES: the transitions by name (game.go's fade) */\nconst HOOKS = { input: [], step: [], enter: [], draw: [], rot: null, frame: null, pose: null, pause: null }, FADES = {};\n\n/* =============================================================================\n83:const E = { version: '0.85.2', build: 'dev-build', name: 'my-3D2dge', TAU, DEG, current: null };\n10370:const E = My3D2dge, game = new E.Game({ headless: true }), cab = new E.Arcade(game, { id: 'doc', lives: 2, extra: [500] });\n10602:const E = My3D2dge, game = new E.Game({ headless: true });\n10950:const E = My3D2dge, map = new E.TileMap({ w: 30, h: 30 }), car = new E.Car({ x: 40, y: 40, angle: 0 });\n11184:const E = My3D2dge, game = new E.Game({ headless: true });\n    this.offset = 0; this.drift = 0; this.anchors = 0; this._ats = []; this._beats = []; this._fading = []; this._stings = []; this._fr = null; this._timer = null;\n    // sound draws its own random numbers (noise, pitch variation): whether sound is on, muted or not yet unlocked by a tap\n    // never shifts the game's Math.random, so the same seed and inputs play the same game with or without it\n    this._rnd = rng(0x51A7E);\n  }\n  _init() {\n    if (this.ctx || this.failed) return this.ctx;\n    try {\n      const AC = window.AudioContext || window.webkitAudioContext; if (!AC) throw new Error('Web Audio is not available');\n      const c = this.ctx = new AC();\n      this._master = c.createGain(); this._master.connect(c.destination);\n      this._sfxBus = c.createGain(); this._sfxBus.connect(this._master);\n      this._musBus = c.createGain(); this._musBus.connect(this._master);\n      this.applyVolume();\n      const nb = c.createBuffer(1, c.sampleRate, c.sampleRate), d = nb.getChannelData(0); for (let i = 0; i < d.length; i++) d[i] = this._rnd() * 2 - 1;\n      this._noise = nb;","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"320246ab-3447-463f-809e-86ed7a6b39d9","uuid":"11577719-d40b-47c4-b927-46ba88512a2b","timestamp":"2026-11-04T12:07:28.385Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"   weather, input sequences, the camera's window): each puts its functions here as it loads, so a kit without it has\n   nothing to call. input(game, dt) after the input's step, step(game, dt) after the timers (game time: paused, frozen\n   and slowed with the game), enter(game, old) as a scene starts (before its enter), draw(game, r, g) over the lit\n   world, under the overlays; rot(spr, a, steps): a sprite turned (section 2b); frame(game, shx, shy): a split screen's\n   viewports drawn (section 10j); pose(dt, s): the traversal moves' poses, on the rig (this; section 16c); pause(shell, acts):\n   the pause menu's Save and Load (section 10k); FADES: the transitions by name (game.go's fade) */\nconst HOOKS = { input: [], step: [], enter: [], draw: [], rot: null, frame: null, pose: null, pause: null }, FADES = {};\n\n/* =============================================================================\n83:const E = { version: '0.85.2', build: 'dev-build', name: 'my-3D2dge', TAU, DEG, current: null };\n10370:const E = My3D2dge, game = new E.Game({ headless: true }), cab = new E.Arcade(game, { id: 'doc', lives: 2, extra: [500] });\n10602:const E = My3D2dge, game = new E.Game({ headless: true });\n10950:const E = My3D2dge, map = new E.TileMap({ w: 30, h: 30 }), car = new E.Car({ x: 40, y: 40, angle: 0 });\n11184:const E = My3D2dge, game = new E.Game({ headless: true });\n    this.offset = 0; this.drift = 0; this.anchors = 0; this._ats = []; this._beats = []; this._fading = []; this._stings = []; this._fr = null; this._timer = null;\n    // sound draws its own random numbers (noise, pitch variation): whether sound is on, muted or not yet unlocked by a tap\n    // never shifts the game's Math.random, so the same seed and inputs play the same game with or without it\n    this._rnd = rng(0x51A7E);\n  }\n  _init() {\n    if (this.ctx || this.failed) return this.ctx;\n    try {\n      const AC = window.AudioContext || window.webkitAudioContext; if (!AC) throw new Error('Web Audio is not available');\n      const c = this.ctx = new AC();\n      this._master = c.createGain(); this._master.connect(c.destination);\n      this._sfxBus = c.createGain(); this._sfxBus.connect(this._master);\n      this._musBus = c.createGain(); this._musBus.connect(this._master);\n      this.applyVolume();\n      const nb = c.createBuffer(1, c.sampleRate, c.sampleRate), d = nb.getChannelData(0); for (let i = 0; i < d.length; i++) d[i] = this._rnd() * 2 - 1;\n      this._noise = nb;","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01E41TRjyfkD36gRYkfQX4q5","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
