{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CghyWoM8FjhZBigDTXWLp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_013hfZC9c2mdWABH4itdB7rM","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build__20261104-050256__x4339a3/work/MashTV-SmashTV-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261104-050256; python3 - <<'EOF'\ndef sub(p, old, new):\n    s=open(p).read(); assert old in s, (p, old[:70]); s=s.replace(old,new,1); open(p,'w').write(s)\nsub('src/40-bot.js', \"  add(AR.CX, AR.CY, .25);\", \"  add(AR.CX, AR.CY, .25);\\n  for (const q of world.contestants) if (q !== c && q.alive) { const d = dist(q, c); if (d < 34) add(q.x + (q.slot - c.slot) * .01, q.y, -1.2 * (34 - d) / 34); }\")\nsub('src/60-play.js', \"  pausable: true, view: 'threequarter', input: MASH_PLAY, touch: [], camera: { zoom: false }, expand: true,\", \"  pausable: true, view: 'threequarter', views: ['threequarter', 'topdown'], input: MASH_PLAY, touch: [], camera: { zoom: false }, expand: true,\")\nEOF\ncat > engine/PATCHES.md <<'EOF'\n# MASH TV engine patches\n\n`engine/my-3d2dge.js` is the handoff's full engine (my-3D2dge v0.85.2, commit 4390a98) with four small patches, applied by\n`node tools/patch-engine.mjs` (which reads `handoff/my-3d2dge.js`). Each is marked `// MASH TV PATCH Pn` in the source.\n\n| # | Patch | Why |\n|---|---|---|\n| P1 | `E.HOOKS = HOOKS;` right after the hook lists are declared | The game must switch every player's input preset each step, after `input.tick` and before the Shell reads navigation: the arrow keys aim in play (8-way fire) but move the focus in menus, the pause screen and our overlays. The hook lists were private. |\n| P2 | The standard `glyphs` setting defaults to `'playstation'`, offers PlayStation or Xbox, and its `apply` sets `glyphs` on every `game.players` input; `addPlayer` copies player 1's glyphs to a player who joins | TASK.md asks for PlayStation glyphs by default with a Settings option for Xbox. The stock default was `'auto'` (Xbox for an unknown pad) and only player 1 was updated. |\n| P3 | `E.Arcade.enter(score, mode, done, input)` reads the given input (default `game.input`); `continue()` takes a press from any `game.players` input | In co-op each contestant enters their own initials with their own controller, and any player may continue. |\n| P4 | `get bus()` on the audio object: the effects bus (null before the first sound) | The Babble voices and the crowd are built from raw Web Audio nodes; routing them through the effects bus makes them obey the volume, effects and mute settings. |\n\nNo other engine code was changed. Everything else (the game's own HUD, UI kit, glyph icons, 10-foot CSS for the Shell,\nnetcode, voices) lives in the game's source.\nEOF\nnode tools/build.mjs | tail -1","description":"Bot separation, scene views, PATCHES.md, rebuild"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1790,"cache_read_input_tokens":822699,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1790},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"320246ab-3447-463f-809e-86ed7a6b39d9","uuid":"07e762a5-5b3f-4ba5-ba38-f875c01611c0","timestamp":"2026-11-04T13:35:06.121Z","request_id":"req_011CghyWnxKHw6gXqwzDQLDg","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_013hfZC9c2mdWABH4itdB7rM":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build__20261104-050256__x4339a3/work/MashTV-SmashTV-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261104-050256; python3 - <<'EOF'\ndef sub(p, old, new):\n    s=open(p).read(); assert old in s, (p, old[:70]); s=s.replace(old,new,1); open(p,'w').write(s)\nsub('src/40-bot.js', \"  add(AR.CX, AR.CY, .25);\", \"  add(AR.CX, AR.CY, .25);\\n  for (const q of world.contestants) if (q !== c && q.alive) { const d = dist(q, c); if (d < 34) add(q.x + (q.slot - c.slot) * .01, q.y, -1.2 * (34 - d) / 34); }\")\nsub('src/60-play.js', \"  pausable: true, view: 'threequarter', input: MASH_PLAY, touch: [], camera: { zoom: false }, expand: true,\", \"  pausable: true, view: 'threequarter', views: ['threequarter', 'topdown'], input: MASH_PLAY, touch: [], camera: { zoom: false }, expand: true,\")\nEOF\ncat > engine/PATCHES.md <<'EOF'\n# MASH TV engine patches\n\n`engine/my-3d2dge.js` is the handoff's full engine (my-3D2dge v0.85.2, commit 4390a98) with four small patches, applied by\n`node tools/patch-engine.mjs` (which reads `handoff/my-3d2dge.js`). Each is marked `// MASH TV PATCH Pn` in the source.\n\n| # | Patch | Why |\n|---|---|---|\n| P1 | `E.HOOKS = HOOKS;` right after the hook lists are declared | The game must switch every player's input preset each step, after `input.tick` and before the Shell reads navigation: the arrow keys aim in play (8-way fire) but move the focus in menus, the pause screen and our overlays. The hook lists were private. |\n| P2 | The standard `glyphs` setting defaults to `'playstation'`, offers PlayStation or Xbox, and its `apply` sets `glyphs` on every `game.players` input; `addPlayer` copies player 1's glyphs to a player who joins | TASK.md asks for PlayStation glyphs by default with a Settings option for Xbox. The stock default was `'auto'` (Xbox for an unknown pad) and only player 1 was updated. |\n| P3 | `E.Arcade.enter(score, mode, done, input)` reads the given input (default `game.input`); `continue()` takes a press from any `game.players` input | In co-op each contestant enters their own initials with their own controller, and any player may continue. |\n| P4 | `get bus()` on the audio object: the effects bus (null before the first sound) | The Babble voices and the crowd are built from raw Web Audio nodes; routing them through the effects bus makes them obey the volume, effects and mute settings. |\n\nNo other engine code was changed. Everything else (the game's own HUD, UI kit, glyph icons, 10-foot CSS for the Shell,\nnetcode, voices) lives in the game's source.\nEOF\nnode tools/build.mjs | tail -1","description":"Bot separation, scene views, PATCHES.md, rebuild"}}}
