{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CghyrVsxTVTxL15H5VLqY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"That reads well at 1080p. While the tests finish, a short README for the dev folder covering commands, deep links and how to add content:"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2944,"cache_read_input_tokens":848104,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2944},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"320246ab-3447-463f-809e-86ed7a6b39d9","uuid":"2fa98c99-336a-4c68-b1cb-e19290622b4e","timestamp":"2026-11-04T13:39:17.183Z","request_id":"req_011CghyrVUtLhBLV4osWZTgt"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CghyrVsxTVTxL15H5VLqY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Jgj1Hfdk4giryTCCtQPMw5","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build__20261104-050256__x4339a3/work/MashTV-SmashTV-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261104-050256/README.md","content":"# MASH TV (dev folder)\n\nA 1-4 player twin-stick arena shooter set inside the deadliest game show on television, on the my-3D2dge engine.\nThe deliverable is `../MashTV-SmashTV-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261104-050256.html` (one file, opens from `file://`).\n\n## Commands\n\n- `npm run build`: concatenates `src/*.js` into `build/game.js`, writes the single-file deliverable and `../exit-interview.json`\n  (from `src/about.json`), and `build/dev.html` (separate scripts, for iteration).\n- `npm test` (`node tools/test.mjs [--only a,b] [--no-browser]`): rebuilds, runs every suite in `tests/`, prints only\n  failures and one summary line.\n- `node tools/balance.mjs [rooms] [players] [diff]`: a human-like bot plays rooms; clear times, deaths, Prime Time.\n- `node tools/shot.mjs <hash> ...`: screenshots of deep links into `shots/`. `node tools/audiocheck.mjs`: every sound\n  and voice played in Chromium. `node tools/patch-engine.mjs`: re-applies the engine patches (`engine/PATCHES.md`).\n\n## Deep links (append to the HTML's URL)\n\n`#title #lobby #howto #scores #about #attract #episodes`, `#room=2-3`, `#boss=1|2|3`, `#greenroom`, `#lightning`,\n`#recap=2`, `#continue`, `#gameover`, `#initials`, `#ending=a|b`, `#credits`, `#coldopen`, `#episode=2`, `#dev`, `#card`;\noptions `&players=N&bot=1&god=1&seed=N`.\n\n## Adding content (data, not code)\n\n- A room: one entry in `MT.ROOMS` (`src/20-content-episodes.js`): waves `{ at, left, spawn: [[door, kind, n, gap]], items }`,\n  `place`, `items`, `key`, `hazards`, `exits`. Dev mode's WARP and the room-sweep test pick it up.\n- An episode: one entry in `MT.EPISODES` plus its rooms. An enemy: one entry in `MT.ENEMIES` (`src/13-enemies.js`).\n  A weapon: one entry in `MT.WEAPONS`. A line, prize or sponsor: `MT.TEXT` (`src/21-content-script.js`).\n- Balance: dev mode's TUNING sliders, then EXPORT TUNING, pasted into `MT.TDEF` (`src/00-core.js`).\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2944,"cache_read_input_tokens":848104,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2944},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"320246ab-3447-463f-809e-86ed7a6b39d9","uuid":"e16ab517-bd88-4255-bbdb-418133235779","timestamp":"2026-11-04T13:39:25.366Z","request_id":"req_011CghyrVUtLhBLV4osWZTgt","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01Jgj1Hfdk4giryTCCtQPMw5":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build__20261104-050256__x4339a3/work/MashTV-SmashTV-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261104-050256/README.md","content":"# MASH TV (dev folder)\n\nA 1-4 player twin-stick arena shooter set inside the deadliest game show on television, on the my-3D2dge engine.\nThe deliverable is `../MashTV-SmashTV-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261104-050256.html` (one file, opens from `file://`).\n\n## Commands\n\n- `npm run build`: concatenates `src/*.js` into `build/game.js`, writes the single-file deliverable and `../exit-interview.json`\n  (from `src/about.json`), and `build/dev.html` (separate scripts, for iteration).\n- `npm test` (`node tools/test.mjs [--only a,b] [--no-browser]`): rebuilds, runs every suite in `tests/`, prints only\n  failures and one summary line.\n- `node tools/balance.mjs [rooms] [players] [diff]`: a human-like bot plays rooms; clear times, deaths, Prime Time.\n- `node tools/shot.mjs <hash> ...`: screenshots of deep links into `shots/`. `node tools/audiocheck.mjs`: every sound\n  and voice played in Chromium. `node tools/patch-engine.mjs`: re-applies the engine patches (`engine/PATCHES.md`).\n\n## Deep links (append to the HTML's URL)\n\n`#title #lobby #howto #scores #about #attract #episodes`, `#room=2-3`, `#boss=1|2|3`, `#greenroom`, `#lightning`,\n`#recap=2`, `#continue`, `#gameover`, `#initials`, `#ending=a|b`, `#credits`, `#coldopen`, `#episode=2`, `#dev`, `#card`;\noptions `&players=N&bot=1&god=1&seed=N`.\n\n## Adding content (data, not code)\n\n- A room: one entry in `MT.ROOMS` (`src/20-content-episodes.js`): waves `{ at, left, spawn: [[door, kind, n, gap]], items }`,\n  `place`, `items`, `key`, `hazards`, `exits`. Dev mode's WARP and the room-sweep test pick it up.\n- An episode: one entry in `MT.EPISODES` plus its rooms. An enemy: one entry in `MT.ENEMIES` (`src/13-enemies.js`).\n  A weapon: one entry in `MT.WEAPONS`. A line, prize or sponsor: `MT.TEXT` (`src/21-content-script.js`).\n- Balance: dev mode's TUNING sliders, then EXPORT TUNING, pasted into `MT.TDEF` (`src/00-core.js`).\n"}}}
